{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:18.40.060","page_type":"section"},"citation":"18.40.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.40.060","content_hash":"dd22ed464f1feeaa58f89ba40ea69244fd04b3d52f5cb2f435bc23aaf4384ce5","heading":"Minimum street dimensions.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.40.060:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.40.060","text":"(a) All streets, alleys and public ways included in any subdivision to be dedicated and accepted shall not be less than the minimum dimensions for each classification as follows:\n| | | Feet\n(1) | Major traffic thoroughfares: |\n| (i) | Primary dual roadway | 120\n| (ii) | Primary single roadway | 100\n| (iii) | Secondary | 80\n(2) | Collectors: |\n| (i) | Primary | 70\n| (ii) | Secondary | 70\n(3) | Minor streets | 60\n(4) | Culs-de-sac: 50-foot radius on turnaround. |\n(5) | Marginal access streets or frontage streets: |\n| (i) | Two-way | 60\n| (ii) | One-way | 50\n(6) | Alleys | 20\n(7) | Pedestrian ways | 10\nFeet\n(1)\nMajor traffic thoroughfares:\n(i)\nPrimary dual roadway\n120\n(ii)\nPrimary single roadway\n100\n(iii)\nSecondary\n80\n(2)\nCollectors:\n(i)\nPrimary\n70\n(ii)\nSecondary\n70\n(3)\nMinor streets\n60\n(4)\nCuls-de-sac: 50-foot radius on turnaround.\n(5)\nMarginal access streets or frontage streets:\n(i)\nTwo-way\n60\n(ii)\nOne-way\n50\n(6)\nAlleys\n20\n(7)\nPedestrian ways\n10\n(b) When existing or anticipated traffic on primary and secondary thoroughfares in subdivisions warrants greater widths of rights-of-way, such widths shall be required.\n(c) Intersections involving two major traffic thoroughfares in subdivisions shall be designed in accordance with the design standard for major intersections. (Code 1981 § 41-94. Code 1995 § 134-136.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"33cdc903-64e7-52e7-b304-e4b885198c70"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.40.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.40.060","content_hash":"6601138c65598f1ba55d322deb0b2c8bdb503733d98df4ea728eeebdb9aec0ac","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.40.060:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.40.060:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.40.060","text":"(a) All streets, alleys and public ways included in any subdivision to be dedicated and accepted shall not be less than the minimum dimensions for each classification as follows:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"897b3488-e512-5fcb-9401-4c6cae2c978b"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"table"},"citation":"18.40.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.40.060","content_hash":"83bb365a41c083a1ccd5d9949cefcea9006a6439963e82243ae1b5a5a508b85d","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.40.060:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.40.060:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.40.060","text":"| | | Feet\n(1) | Major traffic thoroughfares: |\n| (i) | Primary dual roadway | 120\n| (ii) | Primary single roadway | 100\n| (iii) | Secondary | 80\n(2) | Collectors: |\n| (i) | Primary | 70\n| (ii) | Secondary | 70\n(3) | Minor streets | 60\n(4) | Culs-de-sac: 50-foot radius on turnaround. |\n(5) | Marginal access streets or frontage streets: |\n| (i) | Two-way | 60\n| (ii) | One-way | 50\n(6) | Alleys | 20\n(7) | Pedestrian ways | 10","type":"table","workbench_component_id":"91269ba7-fbd8-55a6-ada3-82e9c8369131"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.40.060","citation_url":"h